%% Mermaid diagram: Endpoint Feedback Loop
flowchart TD
    A[Endpoint agent syncs confirmed entries] --> B[Collect local telemetry]
    B --> C[Combine intelligence with telemetry]
    C --> D[Classify event and decide]
    D --> E{Malicious or suspicious?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Apply remediation]
    F --> G[Generate sanitized telemetry]
    G --> H[Submit digest to evidence store and ledger]
    E -- No --> I[Continue monitoring]